<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="An independent guide to checking JazzCash account levels and finding official account-upgrade guidance.">
  <title>JazzCash Account Level Guide</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: light;
      --green: #087a48;
      --green-dark: #075c38;
      --ink: #183129;
      --muted: #53665e;
      --surface: #ffffff;
      --background: #f3f8f5;
      --border: #dce9e1;
      --warning: #fff7df;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      color: var(--ink);
      background: var(--background);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    a { color: var(--green-dark); }
    a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #e4a900; outline-offset: 3px; }

    .topbar {
      padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
      color: #fff;
      background: var(--green-dark);
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    main { width: min(920px, calc(100% - 2rem)); margin: 2.5rem auto; }

    .hero, .card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgb(18 61 39 / 6%);
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--green);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
    }

    h1 { margin: 0.4rem 0 1rem; line-height: 1.15; font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.4rem); }
    h2 { margin-top: 0; font-size: 1.45rem; }
    p { color: var(--muted); }

    .notice {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
      background: var(--warning);
      border-left: 4px solid #d89b00;
      border-radius: 8px;
      color: #493600;
    }

    .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; margin: 1rem 0; }
    .card { padding: 1.4rem; box-shadow: none; }
    .card p { margin-bottom: 0; }

    .steps { padding-left: 1.25rem; }
    .steps li { margin: 0.65rem 0; }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
      padding: 0.8rem 1.1rem;
      color: #fff;
      background: var(--green);
      border-radius: 9px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .button:hover { background: var(--green-dark); }
    footer { padding: 1.5rem 1rem 2rem; text-align: center; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    footer p { margin: 0.35rem; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="topbar">Independent information page — not an official JazzCash website</div>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="page-title">
      <div class="eyebrow">Account guidance</div>
      <h1>Checking your JazzCash account level</h1>
      <p>This page explains how to find trustworthy guidance if you want to move from L0 to L1. Upgrade requirements and available steps can change, so confirm them directly with JazzCash.</p>
      <div class="notice"><strong>Protect your account:</strong> Never share your PIN, password, one-time code (OTP), or full identity details on this page or with someone contacting you unexpectedly. This website does not collect or verify account information.</div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="steps-title" style="margin-top: 1.5rem">
      <div class="card">
        <h2 id="steps-title">What to do</h2>
        <ol class="steps">
          <li>Open the official JazzCash app installed from your device’s trusted app store, or use another official channel provided by JazzCash.</li>
          <li>Look in the app for account/profile details and any account-level or upgrade guidance currently shown to you.</li>
          <li>Follow only the instructions shown in the official app or confirmed by JazzCash support. Requirements may depend on your account and current policy.</li>
          <li>If the option is missing or you need help, contact JazzCash using contact details published on its official website.</li>
        </ol>
        <a class="button" href="https://www.jazzcash.com.pk/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit the official JazzCash website</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="grid" aria-label="Safety reminders">
      <article class="card">
        <h2>Never enter secrets here</h2>
        <p>This guide has no login, PIN, OTP, payment, or identity-verification forms.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h2>Check the website address</h2>
        <p>Before sharing information, make sure you are using a channel reached through JazzCash’s official website or app.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h2>Be cautious of urgent requests</h2>
        <p>Do not follow unsolicited links or share a verification code with anyone who calls or messages you.</p>
      </article>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>This is an independent informational page and is not affiliated with or endorsed by JazzCash.</p>
    <p>Always verify current account requirements through official JazzCash channels.</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
